# 40 synthetic hardware products in English, German, French and Italian, each already in a real leaf category
# of hardware-categories.impex (import that first). Invented brands; written as shop copy, not as category names.
# Used to measure category suggestions with jevCategoryDryRunCronJob, one run per session language.
